OL,3,ATwo dead and 10 hurt after car rams
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been killed and 10
OL,7,Fothers injured after a car crashed into
OL,8,Fa group of people near a train station
OL,9,Fin Caen in northern France, French
OL,10,Freports say.
OL,12,F"A car deliberated rammed into
OL,13,Fpedestrians opposite the station,"
OL,14,Flocal prefect David Claviere told
OL,15,Freporters, adding that seven of those
OL,16,Finjured were in a critical condition.
OL,18,FA man was later arrested after
OL,19,Fauthorities launched a major emergency
OL,20,Fresponse in the wider Normandy region.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
