OL,3,ATwo dead and 10 hurt after car rams
OL,4,Ainto crowd in northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaen Mayor Aristide Olivier said
OL,7,Finvestigators were trying to understand
OL,8,Fwhat had led to the driver's actions.
OL,9,FWitnesses said a fight had broken out
OL,10,Fbetween two groups before the incident
OL,11,Ftook place.
